# The memory package's own configuration, on its parent's (B26): pointer
# arithmetic is allowed in memory alone, which places and frees blocks by
# offset, with its own cases, fault runs and poisoning under
# AddressSanitizer. MSVC's C26481 stays on everywhere. And memory/fail
# keeps fail_fast's cause at namespace scope, for the diagnostic entry's
# terminate handler, which reads it with nothing allocated (B25's
# allowance there); B25's token rule holds every other file of memory.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >-
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-pointer-arithmetic,
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-non-const-global-variables
